nge monsters and he finds out that the prison location corresponds to the birthplace of vampires, the old capital Blue Town. Why are vampires trapped in Blue Town? What are those strange monsters attacking them? Our heroes must fight to solve those mysteries.\n\n(Source: Haoliners)"},"tags":[{"name":"Vampire","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Assassins","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":79,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Bloodivores","english":"Bloodivores","native":"时空使徒","romaji":"Shikong Shitu","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"时空囚徒"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"ブラッディヴォーレス"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}